---
import { Icon } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
import { href } from '../../site.config.mjs';
const providers = ['OpenAI', 'Anthropic', 'Google', 'xAI', 'ChatGPT Codex', 'Amazon Bedrock'];
---
<section class="providers-section" aria-labelledby="providers"><p class="section-eyebrow">YOUR MODEL. YOUR CREDENTIALS.</p><h2 id="providers">Bring your own model.</h2><div class="provider-tags">{providers.map((name) => <a class="provider-tag" href={href('docs/providers/')}>{name}</a>)}</div><p>Or any OpenAI- or Anthropic-compatible endpoint. Gateways, LiteLLM, local.</p><p>Credentials live in your OS keyring. Never in your config files.</p><p>Layer your configuration: global → trusted project → fragments → environment → managed.</p><a class="section-link" href={href('docs/providers/')}>Connect a provider <Icon name="right-arrow" size="18" /></a></section>
